<Project Sdk="Microsoft.NET.Sdk.Web">

  <!--
    DnnMigration.Api
    ============================================================================
    SDK-style ASP.NET Core 8 Web API for the API layer of the DNN 4.x -> .NET 8
    Clean/Onion Architecture backend. It is the OUTERMOST layer and the
    Backend-for-Frontend (BFF) composition root / HTTP surface consumed by the
    Angular 19 SPA: the Program.cs composition root, the REST Controllers
    (Portals/Modules/Users/Roles/Tabs/Auth/Health), the RFC 7807
    ExceptionHandlingMiddleware, plus JWT Bearer + Swagger + Serilog wiring.

    Web SDK (Microsoft.NET.Sdk.Web), NOT the plain Microsoft.NET.Sdk: it
    implicitly sets OutputType=Exe (this is the executable host / startup
    project), provides the ASP.NET Core 8 shared framework via an implicit
    FrameworkReference (so no Microsoft.AspNetCore.* package or FrameworkReference
    is listed here), and auto-includes + copies appsettings.json,
    appsettings.Development.json and wwwroot/ to the output (so no explicit
    <None Include="appsettings*.json"> content items are required). Rate limiting
    (Microsoft.AspNetCore.RateLimiting) is part of that shared framework and is
    likewise NOT referenced as a package.

    Dependency direction (Clean Architecture, inward only):
        Api -> Application -> Domain ;  Api -> Infrastructure -> Domain
    This project references DnnMigration.Application (service interfaces, DTOs,
    the Common response envelope) and DnnMigration.Infrastructure (DnnDbContext,
    *Repository, JwtService, PasswordHasher concretes wired into DI), with
    DnnMigration.Domain flowing transitively (so it is NOT referenced
    explicitly). It must NEVER be referenced by any other layer. Build/declare
    order: Domain -> Application -> Infrastructure -> Api (LAST).

    Shared build configuration is centralized in backend/Directory.Build.props,
    which MSBuild imports automatically by walking up the directory tree. That
    props file is the single source of truth for TargetFramework (net8.0),
    LangVersion (12.0), Nullable, ImplicitUsings, TreatWarningsAsErrors,
    WarningsNotAsErrors (CS8618), Deterministic and GenerateDocumentationFile, so
    none of those settings are repeated here. RootNamespace/AssemblyName default
    from the file name 'DnnMigration.Api' (matching the required namespace
    DnnMigration.Api.*), so no PropertyGroup or OutputType override is required.

    Package references are limited to what this layer consumes directly:
      * Microsoft.AspNetCore.Authentication.JwtBearer 8.0.11 - JWT Bearer token
        validation middleware (AddAuthentication().AddJwtBearer in Program.cs).
        Its 8.0.x line requires Microsoft.IdentityModel.* >= 7.1.2 (a floor, not a
        pin); the Infrastructure project pins those packages to 8.14.0, so the
        solution-wide NuGet graph unifies UP to 8.14.0 (no downgrade, no
        NU1605/NU1608) for the zero-warning Release build.
      * Microsoft.AspNetCore.OpenApi 8.0.11 - native OpenAPI integration
        (AddEndpointsApiExplorer support).
      * Swashbuckle.AspNetCore 6.9.0 - Swagger / OpenAPI UI generation.
      * Serilog.AspNetCore 8.0.3 - structured logging, request logging and
        correlation IDs.
      * Serilog.Sinks.Console 6.0.0 - console sink for container stdout emission.
    AutoMapper and FluentValidation flow transitively from Application; EF Core /
    SQL Server, BCrypt and the IdentityModel packages flow transitively from
    Infrastructure; none are restated here.

    Structure reference only (NOT a 1:1 port): the legacy VB.NET project
    Library/DotNetNuke.Library.vbproj merely confirms this is a project file. No
    legacy <Import>, ToolsVersion, Option Strict/Explicit, OutputType=Library,
    VB runtime or System.Web* references are carried over.
    ============================================================================
  -->

  <ItemGroup>
    <ProjectReference Include="..\DnnMigration.Application\DnnMigration.Application.csproj" />
    <ProjectReference Include="..\DnnMigration.Infrastructure\DnnMigration.Infrastructure.csproj" />
  </ItemGroup>

  <ItemGroup>
    <PackageReference Include="Microsoft.AspNetCore.Authentication.JwtBearer" Version="8.0.11" />
    <PackageReference Include="Microsoft.AspNetCore.OpenApi" Version="8.0.11" />
    <PackageReference Include="Swashbuckle.AspNetCore" Version="6.9.0" />
    <PackageReference Include="Serilog.AspNetCore" Version="8.0.3" />
    <PackageReference Include="Serilog.Sinks.Console" Version="6.0.0" />
  </ItemGroup>

</Project>
